WEBVTT

00:05.044 --> 00:08.094
<b>All right, here we go!</b>

00:11.634 --> 00:14.434
<b>Come on! Straighten up and look the part!</b>

00:14.434 --> 00:16.514
<b>You look the part too much!</b>

00:16.514 --> 00:17.264
<b>Eh?</b>

00:17.264 --> 00:18.434
<b>Don't say "Eh?"</b>

00:18.434 --> 00:20.514
<b>Look how you're dressed!</b>

00:23.684 --> 00:26.024
<b>You're taking "dress for success" too far.</b>

00:26.024 --> 00:28.814
<b>But these are hand-me-downs
from Siesta-<i>san</i>.</b>

00:28.814 --> 00:31.824
<b>Siesta, you were like this, too?</b>

00:31.824 --> 00:35.664
<b>That aside... So you really intend
to step in as substitute detective.</b>

00:35.664 --> 00:37.994
<b>Of course!</b>

00:37.994 --> 00:41.544
<b>Ultimately, as substitute detective,
Alicia took up the search</b>

00:41.544 --> 00:44.084
<b>for the "Eye of Sapphire."</b>

00:44.084 --> 00:49.254
<b>For starters, the two of us were tasked
with getting the lay of the land...</b>

00:49.254 --> 00:52.134
<b>Now that that's settled, off we go!</b>

00:54.304 --> 00:55.594
<b>Huh?</b>

00:57.394 --> 00:59.014
<b>Um, hey!</b>

01:00.684 --> 01:03.434
<b>Give me a-- Wait up!</b>

01:03.434 --> 01:06.394
<b>Running is fun, isn't it?</b>

01:06.394 --> 01:10.524
<b>That smile is delightful,
like the summer sun,</b>

01:10.524 --> 01:13.944
<b>but put yourself in the place of the guy
who's been roped into accompanying you!</b>

01:19.374 --> 01:23.234
From the very moment you caught my eye

01:19.374 --> 01:23.234
<b>ki</b><b>mi </b><b>wo </b><b>mi</b><b>te</b><b>ta </b><b>a</b><b>no </b><b>hi </b><b>ka</b><b>ra</b>

01:23.414 --> 01:31.354
It felt like everything would change

01:23.414 --> 01:31.354
<b>su</b><b>be</b><b>te </b><b>ga </b><b></b><b>ka</b><b>wa</b><b>ru </b><b>yo</b><b>u </b><b>na </b><b>ki </b><b>ga </b><b>shi</b><b>te</b><b>ta</b>

