01:53.824 --> 01:58.824
<b>o</b><b>na</b><b>ji </b><b>ta</b><b>da </b><b>hi</b><b>to</b><b>ri </b><b>ki</b><b>ta</b><b>i </b><b></b><b>shi</b><b>te</b><b>i</b><b>ta</b>

01:59.194 --> 02:03.044
You know, all those things I was unable to say

01:59.194 --> 02:03.044
<b>ne</b><b>e, </b><b>ki</b><b>mi </b><b>ni </b><b></b><b>i</b><b>e</b><b>na</b><b>ka</b><b>t</b><b>ta </b><b>ko</b><b>to</b>

02:03.294 --> 02:07.884
Have remained bottled up to this day

02:03.294 --> 02:07.884
<b>i</b><b>ma </b><b>mo </b><b>to</b><b>ji</b><b>ko</b><b>me</b><b>te</b><b>ru</b>

02:09.144 --> 02:11.384
My heart is still searching

02:09.144 --> 02:11.384
<b>a</b><b>no </b><b>se</b><b>ka</b><b>i </b><b>de </b><b>mi</b><b>tsu</b><b>ke</b><b>ta</b>

02:11.524 --> 02:13.784
For that important thing

02:11.524 --> 02:13.784
<b>ta</b><b>i</b><b>se</b><b>tsu </b><b>na </b><b>na</b><b>ni</b><b>ka </b><b>wo</b>

02:14.044 --> 02:18.454
It discovered in that world.

02:14.044 --> 02:18.454
<b>ko</b><b>no </b><b>ko</b><b>ko</b><b>ro </b><b>wa </b><b>sa</b><b>ga</b><b>shi</b><b>mo</b><b>to</b><b>me</b><b>te</b><b>ru</b>

02:18.734 --> 02:21.434
Hey, I want us to always smile together

02:18.734 --> 02:21.434
<b>ne</b><b>e, </b><b>zu</b><b>t</b><b>to </b><b>ko</b><b>ko </b><b>de </b><b>ki</b><b>mi </b><b>to</b>

02:21.654 --> 02:24.084
So right here and now

02:21.654 --> 02:24.084
<b>wa</b><b>ra</b><b>t</b><b>te </b><b>i</b><b>ra</b><b>re</b><b>ru </b><b>yo</b><b>u </b><b>ni</b>

02:24.364 --> 02:27.874
I'll make you a promise

02:24.364 --> 02:27.874
<b>ya</b><b>ku</b><b>so</b><b>ku </b><b>wo </b><b>su</b><b>ru </b><b>yo</b>

02:29.514 --> 02:32.054
That will transcend time

02:29.514 --> 02:32.054
<b>to</b><b>ki </b><b>wo </b><b>ko</b><b>e</b><b>te, </b><b>i</b><b>ma</b>

02:48.544 --> 02:52.544
Episode 7

02:48.544 --> 02:52.544
Episode 7

02:48.544 --> 02:52.544
In Time, You'll Recall This Day

02:48.544 --> 02:52.544
In Time, You'll Recall This Day

02:52.254 --> 02:54.044
<b>Listen up, Alicia.</b>

02:54.044 --> 02:54.884
<b>Hm?</b>

02:54.884 --> 02:57.304
<b>Brimming over with curiosity is great,</b>

02:57.304 --> 03:01.884
<b>but you're the girl from Wonderland
who doesn't even know who she is.</b>

03:01.884 --> 03:04.684
<b>You need to listen to me just a little.</b>

03:04.684 --> 03:07.814
<b>Gallivanting around by
yourself is prohibited.</b>

03:07.814 --> 03:11.814
<b>I get it, okay? I get it,
so don't treat me like a child.</b>

03:11.814 --> 03:15.614
<b>Okay, good girl. Well, let's go.</b>

03:15.614 --> 03:16.864
<b>Right.</b>

03:18.654 --> 03:21.494
<b>But wait, why are you holding my hand?</b>

03:21.494 --> 03:25.164
<b>Once again I was almost duped
by an action that seemed natural.</b>

03:25.164 --> 03:29.124
<b>Here, Alicia, at a pedestrian crosswalk,
you raise your hand like this.</b>

03:29.124 --> 03:33.924
<b>Seriously, I told you I'm 17!</b>

03:33.924 --> 03:35.464
<b>Probably...</b>

03:42.264 --> 03:46.394
<b>At least, I thought
I was around that age...</b>

03:49.684 --> 03:53.064
<b>Well, you know, there's no need
to worry about it too much.</b>

03:53.064 --> 03:57.694
<b>Kimizuka, it's here!
We've just solved the case.</b>

04:01.574 --> 04:04.534
<b>Wow, look at that.</b>

04:10.204 --> 04:13.874
<b>Wait, wait. Are you thinking
of making me buy that?</b>

04:13.874 --> 04:15.214
<b>You won't buy it?</b>

04:15.214 --> 04:17.134
<b>I <i>can't </i>buy it.</b>

04:18.344 --> 04:20.464
<b>Kimizuka, are you poor?</b>

04:20.464 --> 04:23.634
<b>Hush. That's just a common gemstone.</b>

04:23.634 --> 04:26.474
<b>What we're looking for
is more of a different...</b>

04:26.474 --> 04:30.724
<b>...you know, underground
kind of something.</b>

04:30.724 --> 04:34.064
<b>Underground...</b>

04:34.064 --> 04:35.694
<b>I've got it!</b>

04:36.604 --> 04:42.074
<b>You haven't got it. I'm absolutely
sure you haven't got it... so stop!</b>

04:55.834 --> 04:57.504
<b>This is the place--no mistake!</b>

04:57.504 --> 05:00.424
<b>Your head is chock-full
of nothing but mistakes.</b>

05:02.804 --> 05:07.644
<b>Huh? Where did she go?</b>

05:12.854 --> 05:16.984
<b>Wow. This looks sweet.</b>

05:16.984 --> 05:21.024
<b>Goofball. You might never
recover from eating that!</b>

05:25.404 --> 05:32.664
<b>Ahh, this is exhausting. "Getting the
lay of the land"? This is babysitting.</b>

05:32.664 --> 05:37.294
<b>When she realized she had amnesia,
she was shaken up,</b>

05:37.294 --> 05:40.214
<b>but now she's fully caught up
in being a legendary detective.</b>

05:41.794 --> 05:43.094
<b>You look like you're having fun.</b>

05:43.094 --> 05:47.634
<b>Yeah, it's fun! 'Cuz it's the first time
I've been able to go outside in a while.</b>

05:47.634 --> 05:50.014
<b>I see...</b>

05:50.014 --> 05:53.014
<b>"A while"? What do you mean?</b>

05:56.104 --> 06:00.194
<b>Huh? I wonder why I thought
it'd been a long time.</b>

06:00.194 --> 06:04.324
<b>Were you indoors in a room somewhere for
a long time? Or dare I say, a hospital?</b>

06:04.324 --> 06:09.914
<b>Hmm, I dunno. When I think
about it, somehow my head--</b>

06:09.914 --> 06:13.284
<b>Well, no need to force yourself
to try to remember.</b>

06:13.284 --> 06:16.954
<b>There are cases like this where time
resolves the problem for you.</b>

06:16.954 --> 06:19.334
<b>What's more, once her injury heals,
Siesta will explore some avenues--</b>

06:19.334 --> 06:20.214
<b>Oh!</b>

06:20.214 --> 06:21.464
<b>Huh?</b>

06:26.924 --> 06:28.594
<b>What are you looking at?</b>

06:28.594 --> 06:29.974
<b>This.</b>

06:31.934 --> 06:33.764
<b>I don't think that's quite it.</b>

06:33.764 --> 06:35.974
<b>Oh. It's not...</b>

06:35.974 --> 06:40.354
<b>Well, it's not something we'll
find immediately like that.</b>

06:40.354 --> 06:44.154
<b>Do you think it's about time
we head... home...?</b>

06:44.154 --> 06:45.904
<b>Wha--? Where?</b>

06:47.744 --> 06:50.034
<b>What the--?</b>

06:50.034 --> 06:55.414
<b>Never a dull moment with this one.
Looks like more busy days ahead of me.</b>

07:22.354 --> 07:25.614
<b>Here's to Siesta's being fully recovered.</b>

07:25.614 --> 07:28.284
<b>Cheers!</b>

07:28.284 --> 07:32.744
<b>I've already lost count of how
many toasts we've done.</b>

07:32.744 --> 07:36.834
<b>I thought the energy behind that
meant it was our last toast.</b>

07:36.834 --> 07:39.584
<b>But there's something on
here you'd probably like.</b>

07:39.584 --> 07:43.214
<b>I see. Okay, order just that for me.</b>

07:43.214 --> 07:44.964
<b>But it's already 9:00.</b>

07:44.964 --> 07:46.714
<b>Oh, you're right.</b>

07:46.714 --> 07:49.674
<b>Siesta, just lay off the spicy stuff.</b>

07:49.674 --> 07:52.304
<b>Yeah, I was on the verge
of getting indigestion</b>

07:52.304 --> 07:54.344
<b>and not being able to sleep again.</b>

07:54.344 --> 07:58.684
<b>Here, take some of this antacid, in any
case. You're gonna eat more, right?</b>

07:58.684 --> 08:01.144
<b>I see your point; I'll take some.</b>

08:03.024 --> 08:03.984
<b>Yikes.</b>

08:03.984 --> 08:04.944
<b>Eh?</b>

08:04.944 --> 08:08.324
<b>It scares me how much you two are in sync.</b>

08:08.324 --> 08:11.784
<b>Kimizuka, you let Siesta-<i>san</i>
decide everything for you,</b>

08:11.784 --> 08:16.994
<b>while, Siesta-<i>san</i>, you do what Kimizuka
says without any hesitation at all.</b>

08:16.994 --> 08:21.504
<b>It's because we both trust each other
more than we trust ourselves.</b>

08:21.504 --> 08:24.794
<b>So, basically, you're lovebir--</b>

08:24.794 --> 08:28.294
<b>Excuse me, I'd like to
place another order.</b>

08:28.294 --> 08:32.424
<b>A legendary detective through and through.
Implacable, even towards a child.</b>

08:32.424 --> 08:34.514
<b>It's wrong for her to mock grown-ups.</b>

08:34.514 --> 08:37.474
<b>You're one to talk, when you
don't act grown up yourself!</b>

08:38.554 --> 08:41.064
<b>I'm going to have another drink.</b>

08:42.854 --> 08:46.274
<b>Excuse me, a Cinderella, please!</b>

08:46.274 --> 08:51.444
<b>In any case, I'm glad we found
a place for you to return to.</b>

08:51.444 --> 08:56.114
<b>Yeah! I went to the church yesterday
and it was super fun!</b>

08:57.494 --> 09:00.994
<b>Well, that's still only
treating the symptoms.</b>

09:00.994 --> 09:04.214
<b>As long as you have no memory
and don't know who you are, Alicia,</b>

09:04.214 --> 09:07.924
<b>we won't arrive at a fundamental
solution to this problem.</b>

09:09.214 --> 09:15.094
<b>There were other children there who
were orphans like me, that I played with.</b>

09:15.094 --> 09:18.934
<b>It was kind of like school; I was so glad!</b>

09:22.474 --> 09:27.024
<b>School, eh? I haven't attended
in a while either.</b>

09:27.024 --> 09:33.074
<b>Why are you looking at me? The crepes
and <i>takoyaki </i>were both tasty, right?</b>

09:33.074 --> 09:37.534
<b>I only remember eating too much
and getting a stomachache.</b>

09:43.704 --> 09:45.794
<b>You look like you want to say something.</b>

09:45.794 --> 09:47.674
<b>Nothing in particular.</b>

09:47.674 --> 09:53.054
<b>Well, still... that ribbon
did suit you well.</b>

09:53.054 --> 09:55.094
<b>You were staring pretty excessively.</b>

09:55.094 --> 09:59.094
<b>I wasn't staring. I was only
staring very casually.</b>

09:59.094 --> 10:01.224
<b>Sidekick, what language are you speaking?</b>

10:01.224 --> 10:04.774
<b>Well now, was that an attempt at humor?</b>

10:04.774 --> 10:07.814
<b>A ribbon sounds nice.</b>

10:07.814 --> 10:10.274
<b>Okay, I'll get you one sometime.</b>

10:10.274 --> 10:13.404
<b>Really? Yay!</b>

10:13.404 --> 10:19.914
<b>I'd also love to wear one...
and try attending a real school.</b>

10:22.914 --> 10:26.834
<b>Well, no, I don't really
need school or anything,</b>

10:26.834 --> 10:29.374
<b>since I've got other things
to do now anyway.</b>

10:29.374 --> 10:31.214
<b>Detective work?</b>

10:31.214 --> 10:34.594
<b>Yep. So I have no time for going
to school and stuff.</b>

10:34.594 --> 10:40.224
<b>That said, it seems you still haven't
found the "Eye of Sapphire."</b>

10:40.224 --> 10:44.144
<b>I-I know. I'm supposed
to find it, right?</b>

10:44.144 --> 10:46.274
<b>Hey, hey, do you mean to go out now?</b>

10:46.274 --> 10:49.524
<b>Kimizuka, you don't need to come with.</b>

10:49.524 --> 10:53.694
<b>Ah, yes, an emotional roller
coaster, as always.</b>

10:53.694 --> 10:57.364
<b>It's already dark outside.
The ghosts will be out.</b>

10:59.284 --> 11:04.164
<b>Maybe I'll head back to my room for now
and get there early in the morning.</b>

11:05.914 --> 11:11.544
<b>Ahem. Anyway, you'll see--
I'll definitely find it tomorrow!</b>

11:13.884 --> 11:18.174
<b>Here you are. One Cinderella.</b>

11:18.174 --> 11:21.974
<b>In the end, she took off
without drinking her drink.</b>

11:21.974 --> 11:24.764
<b>Not one to follow the
beaten path, that girl.</b>

11:24.764 --> 11:28.394
<b>You must have had a hard time
these two weeks.</b>

11:28.394 --> 11:30.394
<b>I guess so.</b>

11:30.394 --> 11:36.574
<b>But what do we do now? There's the
Alicia question, but there's also Hel...</b>

11:36.574 --> 11:41.954
<b>I have never in my life jumped
ship after taking on a case.</b>

11:43.164 --> 11:47.294
<b>I see. So we're going to go on
living this way for a while?</b>

11:47.294 --> 11:52.044
<b>That's right. Living together,
just the two of us.</b>

11:54.294 --> 11:55.294
<b>What?</b>

11:55.294 --> 12:00.304
<b>Oh. I was just thinking
how peaceful this is.</b>

12:03.974 --> 12:06.264
<b>You're wallowing in sentimentality.</b>

12:06.264 --> 12:08.434
<b>It's not like that.</b>

12:10.934 --> 12:14.854
<b>Hey, what is this? Crap, that's bitter.</b>

12:14.854 --> 12:17.444
<b>You're not trying to--</b>

12:17.444 --> 12:21.944
<b>It's just juice. We're
celebrating me today, right?</b>

12:21.944 --> 12:25.494
<b>You're going to stick around
with me until I'm done.</b>

12:25.494 --> 12:27.954
<b>What do you want to drink, Kimi?</b>

12:27.954 --> 12:30.544
<b>I've already had enough...</b>

12:30.544 --> 12:33.254
<b>You were going to make
something up to me, remember?</b>

12:33.254 --> 12:38.344
<b>"Make something up to you"? Oh, that
apple pie incident from a while back?</b>

12:38.344 --> 12:43.424
<b>You'll do whatever I say... right?</b>

12:45.264 --> 12:48.514
<b>Only one more drink, though.</b>

12:48.514 --> 12:51.474
<b>Uh-huh. I promise.</b>

12:57.404 --> 12:59.194
<b>And then, you know what?</b>

12:59.194 --> 13:02.074
<b>At that time, I was just little,</b>

13:02.074 --> 13:05.824
<b>so I ate the watermelon seeds, and then,
I was nervous, because, like,</b>

13:05.824 --> 13:08.324
<b>what do I do if they
sprout in my stomach?</b>

13:08.324 --> 13:14.004
<b>Why do things seem to be undulating
like that--is it just because I'm tired?</b>

13:14.004 --> 13:18.254
<b>"Just one more,"
she promised and promised...</b>

13:18.254 --> 13:22.054
<b>I think she promised that about ten times.</b>

13:22.054 --> 13:25.134
<b>Sidekick, are you listening to me?</b>

13:25.134 --> 13:27.264
<b>Yeah, of course I'm listening.</b>

13:27.264 --> 13:31.434
<b>You were talking about whether watermelon
is a vegetable or a fruit, right?</b>

13:31.434 --> 13:35.354
<b>Yeah, that's it. At the produce shop,
even though I asked for watermelon,</b>

13:35.354 --> 13:38.234
<b>they gave me muskmelon,
and I was, like, truly shocked.</b>

13:38.234 --> 13:41.444
<b>We've been talking past each other,</b>

13:41.444 --> 13:45.404
<b>and I feel like she's been spouting
nothing but nonsense at me.</b>

13:45.404 --> 13:47.454
<b>It's inconceivable that
that perfectly flawless,</b>

13:47.454 --> 13:51.624
<b>calm, cool, and collected greatest
legendary detective in history</b>

13:49.454 --> 13:54.504
<b>It was melon... Muskmelon-type melon!</b>

13:51.624 --> 13:54.504
<b>would spew out such useless babble.</b>

13:54.504 --> 13:58.504
<b>Surely she is in fact speaking
on some elevated level.</b>

13:58.504 --> 13:59.584
<b>Umm...</b>

13:59.584 --> 14:00.174
<b>Eh?</b>

14:00.174 --> 14:03.884
<b>Why have you stayed
so far away this whole time?</b>

14:07.594 --> 14:10.934
<b>Come over here.</b>

14:10.934 --> 14:12.394
<b>On the bed?</b>

14:12.394 --> 14:15.854
<b>Uh-huh. Let's chat together here.</b>

14:15.854 --> 14:22.114
<b>I'm not sure what to think of that.
A young guy and girl on a bed together...</b>

14:22.114 --> 14:23.864
<b>You're against it?</b>

14:25.574 --> 14:28.034
<b>No, it's not a problem.</b>

14:30.704 --> 14:34.704
<b>This is definitely a first, our being
in bed together like this, huh?</b>

14:38.584 --> 14:41.584
<b>You're extremely close, Kimi.</b>

14:44.134 --> 14:47.054
<b>You do have a face that is completely
forgettable after a couple of days.</b>

14:47.054 --> 14:50.054
<b>Is now the time to say that?</b>

14:51.264 --> 14:54.514
<b>It's because tormenting you is fun.</b>

14:54.514 --> 15:00.104
<b>But actually, you like being
tormented by me, don't you?</b>

15:00.104 --> 15:03.614
<b>Stop concocting such ridiculous notions.</b>

15:03.614 --> 15:09.114
<b>So would you rather I never toy
with you ever again, Kimi?</b>

15:09.114 --> 15:12.204
<b>Would you rather I not talk to you?</b>

15:16.454 --> 15:20.624
<b>You <i>are </i>funny, Kimi.</b>

15:20.624 --> 15:22.384
<b>Hush.</b>

15:22.384 --> 15:25.424
<b>That withdrawn face of yours
is somewhat cute.</b>

15:25.424 --> 15:28.714
<b>That's not exactly a compliment.</b>

15:28.714 --> 15:32.434
<b>Although I'll forget it
in a couple of days.</b>

15:34.144 --> 15:36.354
<b>But still...</b>

15:36.354 --> 15:42.444
<b>I won't ever forget these three
years we've spent together, Kimi.</b>

15:47.024 --> 15:50.194
<b>Somehow, I feel like this conversation
has gotten really serious.</b>

15:50.194 --> 15:53.864
<b>If you took away the seriousness,
what would be left of you?</b>

15:53.864 --> 15:58.704
<b>You're terrible. What do you think I am?</b>

15:58.704 --> 16:06.384
<b>Well, just for once... want to try
doing something... not so serious?</b>

16:35.414 --> 16:38.914
<b>Ugh, I want to die.</b>

16:38.914 --> 16:43.294
<b>What was yesterday's me thinking?</b>

16:52.674 --> 16:54.594
<b>Good morning...</b>

17:25.414 --> 17:29.884
<b>Sidekick. I want you to
hold out your arm for me.</b>

17:29.884 --> 17:35.684
<b>Easy now, Siesta. Put away the
super-thick syringe before you say that.</b>

17:35.684 --> 17:39.054
<b>It's fine; it'll only hurt for an instant.</b>

17:40.264 --> 17:45.064
<b>The solution in this shot has the
effect of erasing recent memories.</b>

17:45.064 --> 17:49.734
<b>We captured that "Restroom Hanako-<i>san</i>"
at the culture festival, remember?</b>

17:49.734 --> 17:54.864
<b>This actually contains a tiny bit
of that same active ingredient.</b>

17:54.864 --> 18:01.124
<b>Th-That's horrendous.
It's conclusively proven to work!</b>

18:01.124 --> 18:04.954
<b>Here now, Sidekick. Hold out your arm.</b>

18:12.214 --> 18:16.474
<b>Sounds like somebody's here.
Shouldn't we answer the door?</b>

18:16.474 --> 18:17.384
<b>Tsk.</b>

18:17.384 --> 18:19.724
<b>Don't "tsk" like that.</b>

18:20.974 --> 18:23.144
<b>Yes?</b>

18:23.144 --> 18:27.234
<b>Things sounded really agitated
in there. What were you doing?</b>

18:31.404 --> 18:34.904
<b>Mission complete!</b>

18:34.904 --> 18:39.994
<b>You didn't really go find the
"Eye of Sapphire" last night...</b>

18:39.994 --> 18:43.584
<b>Rather than rely on a phantom lens
that may or may not exist,</b>

18:43.584 --> 18:48.044
<b>it's more important to take care of that
eye of yours, which definitely exists.</b>

18:54.964 --> 18:57.094
<b>You noticed, huh?</b>

18:57.094 --> 19:01.804
<b>After working together
for two whole weeks, yes.</b>

19:01.804 --> 19:07.144
<b>Thanks to my left eye being wounded that
time, my vision worsened considerably.</b>

19:07.144 --> 19:12.104
<b>For that reason, I kept losing
sight of Alicia around town.</b>

19:12.104 --> 19:15.734
<b>If you don't wear an eye
covering, it won't heal.</b>

19:15.734 --> 19:20.864
<b>It certainly seems I've
been misreading Alicia.</b>

19:20.864 --> 19:26.954
<b>The girl who wore all her emotions on her
sleeve--that was only the surface layer.</b>

19:26.954 --> 19:30.214
<b>Her true nature was indubitably...</b>

19:32.174 --> 19:36.254
<b>That's my answer; is it right?</b>

19:36.254 --> 19:41.884
<b>Is that what this is about?
Was this a conundrum you posed, Siesta?</b>

19:42.844 --> 19:45.264
<b>This... turned out just as I calculated.</b>

19:45.264 --> 19:47.564
<b>Come on, you are <i>not </i>a good liar.</b>

19:50.274 --> 19:53.654
<b>Quick-witted responses
aren't exactly my forte.</b>

19:53.654 --> 19:56.694
<b>It's been a long time since I've
seen that look on your face.</b>

19:56.694 --> 19:58.654
<b>Hush.</b>

19:59.864 --> 20:04.494
<b>Are you that fond of this present
you got from a much younger girl?</b>

20:04.494 --> 20:07.954
<b>No, uh, that's not what this is about...</b>

20:07.954 --> 20:11.914
<b>It's more like I'm only wearing it
because she gave it to me...</b>

20:11.914 --> 20:15.634
<b>No, I'm sorry, that wasn't it.</b>

20:15.634 --> 20:20.344
<b>The truth is, I'm just ashamed of myself
because I failed to show that same kind</b>

20:20.344 --> 20:23.634
<b>of consideration about your eye.</b>

20:23.634 --> 20:27.894
<b>Ah, is that all?
So even you are only human.</b>

20:27.894 --> 20:33.064
<b>I'm glad to see you're a human being
who can be swayed by trifling emotions.</b>

20:33.064 --> 20:34.814
<b>Is that so?</b>

20:45.364 --> 20:47.374
<b>Siesta?</b>

20:47.374 --> 20:48.874
<b>It's nothing.</b>

20:52.874 --> 20:55.334
<b>It's not the time yet.</b>

20:58.424 --> 21:00.254
<b>"Tokyo, Japan"</b>

21:00.924 --> 21:02.974
<b>Hello?</b>

21:02.974 --> 21:07.304
<b>Hey, you worthless punk. You seem
to have kept yourself alive somehow.</b>

21:07.304 --> 21:10.434
<b>I hear you two put on quite a spectacle
at the parliament building.</b>

21:10.434 --> 21:14.484
<b>Fuubi-<i>san</i>, isn't that something you
should've said last time we met?</b>

21:14.484 --> 21:15.734
<b>When it comes down to it,</b>

21:15.734 --> 21:19.984
<b>we took quite a beating thanks to the
Jack the Ripper case you brought to us.</b>

21:19.984 --> 21:23.034
<b>Huh? When are you saying we met?</b>

21:23.034 --> 21:26.244
<b>Wait, what are you talking about?
Two weeks ago.</b>

21:26.244 --> 21:29.534
<b>You told us all that stuff about
the "Eye of Sapphire," remember?</b>

21:29.534 --> 21:35.414
<b>Um, nope. The only time I met you
two over there was at that church.</b>

21:35.414 --> 21:38.544
<b>Who is it you mistook for me?</b>

21:38.544 --> 21:42.344
<b>It can't be. Then who was...?</b>

21:42.344 --> 21:48.014
<b>That's right--she still had the lighter
that she'd previously handed over to me.</b>

21:49.104 --> 21:52.814
<b>Hello? Kimizuka? Hey!</b>

21:52.814 --> 21:54.314
<b>Sidekick!</b>

21:57.144 --> 22:01.364
<b>That Fuubi-<i>san</i>...
could she have actually been...?</b>

